.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt NICE 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm nice
.Nd run a command with an altered niceness
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl n Ar increment
.Op Ar command Op Ar argument ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints the caller's current nice value when no command is given, or executes
.Ar command
after applying
.Ar increment
(default 10).
The resulting value is clamped to the POSIX range
.Pq -20 through 19 .
.Pp
The
.Fl n
form and the traditional
.Fl N
form are accepted.
A bare
.Nm
without
.Fl n
is a query.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl n Ar increment
Add
.Ar increment
to the current nice value before running the command.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A command that cannot be found exits 127; a command that cannot be executed
exits 126.
A usage error exits 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr kill 1 ,
.Xr getpriority 2
.Sh STANDARDS
IEEE Std 1003.1-2024
.Pq POSIX.1-2024 .
